  "body": "Part of #67.\n\n## Problem\nBlockers are free text plus stable reason strings (`presentation.rs`, `lifecycle.rs`). The UI cannot separate these four cases without parsing prose:\n- a protected resource\n- an authority ceiling\n- an external wait, such as a runner queue with a retry time\n- an exhausted budget\n\n## Scope\n- Add `presentation.blocker_kind`, one of:\n  - `protected_resource{path, permission}`\n  - `authority_ceiling{requested, allowed}`\n  - `external_dependency{kind, retry_at?}`\n  - `budget_exhausted{budget}`\n  - `diagnosis_required`\n  - `unknown`\n- `needs` attention is unchanged. It is sti",
